Dear Millburn Families,

I hope you are doing well and that everyone is enjoying their summer!

This is just a friendly reminder that *The Goddard School of Millburn will
be closed for Professional Development Days on Thursday, August 27, 2026,
and Friday, August 28, 2026*.

This was notated on our Summer calendars we sent out earlier in June. We
wanted to provide another reminder well in advance so you have plenty of
time to plan accordingly and mark these dates on your calendar. As the
dates get closer, we will send another reminder.

Thank you for your understanding and continued support. We look forward to
seeing everyone back after the closure!

Best,

Alexa




